sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant EventTemplate as EventTemplate
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+EventTemplate: archive(reason)
    Note over EventTemplate: Policies: eventTemplateRead, eventTemplateWrite, eventTemplateExecute
    Note over EventTemplate: Guards (3)
    EventTemplate->>EventTemplate: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    EventTemplate->>EventTemplate: guard[1]: self.definedAt != null
    EventTemplate->>EventTemplate: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    EventTemplate->>EventTemplate: mutate.status
    EventTemplate->>EventTemplate: mutate.archivedAt
    EventTemplate->>EventTemplate: mutate.archiveReason
    EventTemplate->>EventBus: emit EventTemplateArchived on event_template.archived
    EventTemplate-->>-Client: void